DESCRIPTION:Jazz & Blues Night Datum: 08.11.2026 | Einlass: 18:00 Uhr Beginn: 19:00 | Ende: 21:10 Uhr  vvk 15 AK 18 Future3 is a future jazz trio from Berlin whose sound moves between modern jazz\, broken beat\, hip hop and psychedelic textures. Irina (keys/synths)\, Miguel (bass/synth) and Rodrigo (drums) shape their music through improvisation and electronic production\, drawing on roots in classical music\, electronic music and punk. Their compositions span a broad spectrum while maintaining a distinctive\, contemporary edge. IN EMBERS is a jazz-fusion trio from Vienna\, Austria. With their sound they aspire to redefine a rarely used musical genre\, somewhere between acoustic-electro and jazz-fusion. Founded in 2019\, the band released their first EP "Neon Cascades" in 2021\, followed by their debut full-length album "Living And Dreaming“ in 2026. IN EMBERS consists of Christoph Schön (piano)\, Sebastian Wenzel (drums) and Johannes Duntze (double bass). Christoph and his cousin Sebastian have been making music together since they were 12 years old\, while Johannes joined the band in summer 2021.
URL:https://rhiz.wien/copilotevent/08-11-2026_future3-support-in-embers-future3
